.TH MPVR 1 "2026-10-20" "de-xr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mpvr \- play desktop and stereoscopic XR video with mpv
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
mpvr [XR\-OPTIONS] [MPV\-OPTIONS] [FILE...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
An mpv fork and launcher for GPU side\-by\-side playback in DomeD or an active WiVRn/WayVR session. Existing SBS content is fitted per eye, with subtitles duplicated. No depth synthesis is performed. In automatic mode outside DomeD, unrecognized or mono video stays on the desktop; DomeD can duplicate mono content into both eyes. Unrecognized options are passed to mpv.
.SH APPLICATION MENU
The application-menu entry uses \-\-player-operation-mode=pseudo-gui. With no
file selected it opens an idle desktop window, including when DomeD or XR is
active. Drop media into that window to begin playback. The player exits after
the playlist finishes. Ordinary command-line invocation retains mpv behavior;
use the pseudo-gui option explicitly when an idle window is wanted.
.PP
On Wayland, builds with GIO export the live player menu through KDE AppMenu and
DBusMenu to DomeD's universal menu bar. Playback, tracks, audio, subtitles and
window commands follow the existing context menu and custom menu.conf definitions,
including nested menus, shortcuts and live checked, hidden and disabled states.
Top-level actions appear under Player. Each window owns its export, which is
removed when the window closes. The ordinary context menu remains available
when the compositor or session bus does not support application menus.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B "\-\-xr\-help"
Show launcher\-specific help. \-\-help shows mpv help.
.TP
.B "\-\-xr\-output auto|wayvr|domed|desktop|off"
Select output routing; default auto.
.TP
.B "\-\-domed"
Select the DomeD backend.
.TP
.B "\-\-sbs\-layout auto|full\-sbs|half\-sbs|full\-tb|half\-tb|mono"
Override stereo layout detection. Full/half top-bottom input is repacked to SBS on the GPU.
.TP
.B "\-\-swap\-eyes"
Swap the left and right views.
.TP
.B "\-\-xr\-size WIDTHxHEIGHT"
Select XR output resolution; default 2560x1440.
.SH EXAMPLES
mpvr movie_SBS.mkv
.br
mpvr \-\-domed \-\-sbs\-layout=half\-sbs movie.mkv
.br
mpvr \-\-xr\-output=off movie.mkv
.SH SEE ALSO
mpv(1), qimgvr(1), dome\-compositor(1)
